    "title": "Smart Remote for Samsung TV",
    "description": "Do you want a virtual remote for Samsung smart TVs?\r\nThis Samsung TV remote app gives you full control over your Samsung smart TV from your smartphone. With this best Samsung smart TV Remote Control App, you can use your phone as a virtual remote control to control any Samsung smart TV and enjoy screen time. It\u2019s a simple tv remote control that supports all buttons with an easy to use layout for all Samsung TV users.\r\n\r\n\r\nSamsung tv remote is a free tv remote app with many multiple smart controlling features. With the best Samsung smart tv remote control app, you will be able to control your Samsung TV with just one touch easily. All Samsung tv remote control makes it much easier to control Samsung TVs without looking for a lost remote. With the Samsung smart TV remote, both IR and WiFi are supported. In order to work with the IR mode, your smartphone should have an IR sensor. However, if you want to connect your TV through wifi mode, both devices must be connected to the same wifi network. \r\n\r\n<b>Features of Remote control for Samsung smart tv: </b>\r\nBest Remote to control Samsung smart TVs.\r\nQuick installation and super easy to connect with Samsung TV.\r\nEfficient enough to work on both IR & Wifi.\r\nSupport all menu buttons for control and easy navigation.\r\nEasy to use and Clean interface.\r\nFully functional tv remote for all Samsung smart TVs.\r\nSmooth touchpad.\r\n\r\nThis remote for Samsung is much easier to pair with any Samsung TV conveniently. No more worries about dead batteries or broken physical TV remotes. The Universal tv remote for Samsung TV offers its users a high level of convenience, multiple features, and ease of use. Connect this fast tv remote to your Samsung smart TV with ease to ensure a reliable connection. This free Samsung tv remote control app is able to work efficiently despite distractions from other apps or phone calls and you will stay connected to the app. This is one of the most suitable Samsung TV remotes with complete guidance and support for all menu buttons and a user-friendly interface.",
